🇺🇸🇨🇦 US-Canada "Split" Ends with Canada Doubling Down on US "Burden-Sharing" Directives

▪️The staged "trade war" between the US and Canada, much of Canada's essential industries being controlled by US corporations in the first place, has been used to generate public anger against US President Donald Trump and blind emotionally-driven support for Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney, both men representing the exact same corporate-financier interests;

▪️As part of this theater which includes Canada supposedly reducing Canada's dependence on the US (which is absolute), Canada seeks association with the EU, a US created bloc used to undermine European sovereignty and maximize dependence on the US!

▪️Part of Canada's plan to "reduce dependence on the US," is to double down on funding and support for the US-engineered and led proxy war on Russia in Ukraine;

▪️In other words, what really happened was the US used emotionally charged hatred of President Trump to convince Canadians to rally around PM Carney, another US proxy, to double down on US interests at Canada's own expense;

▪️Back in reality, Canada's economy and especially trade still remains almost entirely dependent on the US - dependence the US is likewise expanding over the EU and its Asia-Pacific proxies;
